	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"It isn't until today, the day of the field trip, that we are able to see Empress Hisui again.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"It's the long-awaited beach trip that we've been preparing for.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"As the student council, our job today is to supervise and oversee the day's events, ensuring that everything runs smoothly.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"─The rhythmic sound of waves breaking on shore.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"─The refreshing scent of the slightly salty sea breeze.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"This just might be the first time I've been to the beach ever since losing my memories.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"As I look out over the horizon, I can just barely make out the sight of a Republican warship in the distance.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Though it only appears as a speck on the horizon, it must be quite large in actuality.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin! Were you waiting here this whole time?”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Akari comes running over, having just finished changing.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"The rest of the girls follow right behind her.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh-What's up?”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well...”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Her regular clothes really do a good job of hiding her figure, it would seem...",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"My gaze is inadvertently stolen away by a certain vexingly feminine convexity.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Clueless to my inner strife, Akari sidles up right next to me.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(I think we should really try to win Kanami over today.)”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Let's look for a chance to bring it up with her.)”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"We share a silent nod with each other.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Um... whatever might you two be talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"The very person in question delicately saunters up to us, showcasing her soft yet supple figure with each step.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Her modest swimsuit, pure as snow, clings demurely to her petite frame.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin was just saying what a treat it is to see so many girls in swimsuits.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hey, nobody said that!”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sure enjoying yourself, aren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're taking her seriously?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Course not. I know better than anyone just how much of a tofu-for-brains you are.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Hotori's physique clearly displays the fruits of her rigorous training.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Hers is a balanced, well-proportioned figure worthy of being cast into marble.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"And yet, she boasts a generous set of feminine curves sure to be the envy of all her peers.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What a wonderful day for some open-air swimming!”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Perhaps to avoid showing more skin than necessary, Elsa has a thin cardigan draped over her shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It isn't a proper beach trip until you take it all off!”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"That is, until Shino appears out of nowhere and summarily relieves her of her last layer.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Awaah?! Shino?!”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Whoa!”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What in the...”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“How bold of you, Elsa-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"The three girls are stunned into speechlessness.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"The swimsuit Elsa is wearing is rather audacious, to say the least.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I-It's not like I'm wearing this because I wanted to!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Shino's the one who picked it out...”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Republicans fill out a bit better, so this sorta look makes for a real nice show, don'tcha think, Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, you're not wrong.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“T-Tokita-kun...”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Elsa's face flushes bright red, and she hastily moves to try and cover her body with her arms.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"She seems entirely oblivious to the fact that this only serves to further accentuate her ample chest.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin... I can't believe you can say that with a straight face.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's my honest impression.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mhm, yep. Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Truly a sight for sore eyes...”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“What a time to be alive! Kurushima Shino could die here and now without any regrets!”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Shino emphatically declares, dabbing at the corners of her eyes with her handkerchief.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Is it just me, or does she seem more interested in her fellow women than anything?",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"I'm not sure I get it.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Besides, where the heck is your swimsuit, Shino?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Even Her Majesty and I went as far as to wear them, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Don't wanna get sunburned.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Listen, you...”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My goodness, everyone! You all look most fetching!”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Kotone pokes her head out behind a certain student council president about to pop a blood vessel.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I have never worn a swimsuit before, so it took me quite some time to get changed.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hrm?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“A-Aweeh...”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's some ambush...”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Kotone quizzically tilts her head, and the motion sets two outsized orbs swaying in unison.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"The juxtaposition with her innocent, cherubic smile is most formidable indeed...",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Beset on all sides by so many charming women of marriageable age, the forces of my self-discipline find themselves in great jeopardy.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"I decide to gaze out at the warship on the horizon to calm the tempest in my heart.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Ah, that fortress of steel floating upon still waters truly befits me.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What're you looking at?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That Republican warship.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, that thing.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If I remember correctly, it's the biggest aircraft carrier in the Republican fleet.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"It's a monstrous vessel, with a deck length over three hundred meters and capable of carrying over eighty attack aircraft.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Most of the bombers that attacked Tenkyo during the war took off from that carrier.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"At present, it appears only to be drifting peacefully in the bay, but that couldn't be farther from the truth.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"With one order from the Government-General, Tenkyo could be reduced to a sea of flames in a matter of minutes.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"It wouldn't be wrong to say that Tenkyo always has a blade right at its throat.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"The titanic aircraft carrier remains anchored off the coast as a constant show of force, in order to crush the Imperial will to resist.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Not very fond of that carrier, are you?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Elsa walks up next to me.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's a stupid question.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Attack aircraft from that very ship were what burned the Warrior District to the ground.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I suppose they did...”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“A week from now, on August 13th, the governor-general is scheduled to return to the mainland on that carrier.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“He intends to take home the reparations he collected from the Imperials and ingratiate himself with some congressmen.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"By “reparations,” she means the money paid as an indemnity for the bombing of the Armistice Day ceremony.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"It was paid to the governor-general by Okonogi, but financed by a tax increase on the general public.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“People connected to the Armistice Day bombing?”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yeah. A certain politician who was supposed to marry Empress Hisui is apparently absolutely furious.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've heard the governor-general is awfully concerned about that sort of thing.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You've heard well.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“He spends a lot more time polishing his nails instead of his gun...”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"She doesn't hide the contempt seeping into her voice.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Who will be in command of the Republican Army while the governor-general is away?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Probably yours truly.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'd like to take this opportunity to carry out Operation Bellflower, but...”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Why does it matter? The Army is behind our operation,\nisn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"If the Republican Army is really on our side, then there should be no need to wait for the governor-general's absence.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But it's easier to get things done if I have full authority.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's a real pain, you know, having to go up the chain of command for every little thing.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That sounds sensible.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If the governor-general is going to leave, we shouldn't pass up this chance.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Elsa nods in agreement.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"It seems like we'll be executing Operation Bellflower while Warren is away in the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Within the next few weeks, the Sworn Blades will finally rise up in the name of Empress Hisui and storm the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“At last, we will be able to topple the chancellor.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“A new era is about to dawn on the Empire, Your Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We'll have to speed up our preparations.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"I nod, sharing a sidelong glance with Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"The notional purpose of this field trip is to practice swimming skills.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Imperials generally learn how to swim in school, but apparently this education is not as widespread in the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"We divide ourselves into groups of students who know how to swim and students who don't, and each group goes about their practice.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Naturally, I've assumed the role of Empress Hisui's private tutor.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I look forward to your tutelage, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't call me that here.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I-I'm sorry...”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Empress Hisui immediately apologizes, shrinking into herself.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry. That came out harsher than I meant.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“No, it's quite all right.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Um, you know...”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There's nobody around right now. So you can call me that if you want.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama! I absolutely will!”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Overwhelmed with joy, Empress Hisui nods over and over.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How are you feeling?”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"I pull her by the hand through the water.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“F-Fine... I think I can handle... Awaah!”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You need to relax, or you won't be able to float properly.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Th-That may be so, but...!”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I won't let you go. Don't worry.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Right!”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"At this, she manages to put her face under for a few seconds, but she still seems a little scared of the water.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It was a long time ago, but do you remember that time we went swimming in Senshu?”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Back then, I was...”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm? What's that floating towards us?”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"A translucent object is drifting through the water.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“A-Aaaaawahhh! A-A jellyfish?!”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Kanami practically leaps out of the ocean into my arms.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did it sting you?”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I-I cannot tell! But it's touching my leg!”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't move.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Y-Yes...! P-Please take it off! Quickly!”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Oh, but then it might sting you, Onii-sama... Please do be careful...”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"I plunge my hands beneath the water and run them along\nKanami's leg.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Hyah!”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Where is it?”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Higher up... On my thigh...”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Here?”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Nnh...! N-No, a little to the left... Hyaah...!”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry... Is this it here?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Aaaah?!”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"I finally get my hands around it.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, it's just some seaweed.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Just some garden-variety seaweed sticking to her, that's all.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Phew... What a terrible fright...”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Kanami breathes a sigh of relief inside my arms.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“O-Onii-sama? Umm...”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Kanami looks up at me with a doe-eyed expression.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Oh, um...”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"The two of us are still clinging to each other in the water.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“S-Sorry...”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"I immediately set her down and release my hands from around her back.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“N-No, I was the one acting improperly...”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ah, that story I was about to tell you... Indeed, I was stung by a jellyfish in the sea at Senshu.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ever since that day, I would refuse to go to the beach unless you were there with me.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I see. I didn't know about that.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But it was not only at the beach that I would stick close behind you, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I was always together with you, whether at home or at the dojo.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Though we were not connected by blood, I was still overjoyed to have a brother I could treat as my very own.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I see...”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It feels strange to ask this, but do you know anything about my birth?”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That is, anything before I became part of House Tokita?”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Unfortunately, I do not.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“All I heard from Father is that I would be getting a new brother.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Perhaps Hotori-chan might know more.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The thing is, she doesn't know anything either.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"It seems like the master of the house never told anyone about my circumstances.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Which means I must have had a rather troubled past.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Perhaps I was a misbegotten child, or found abandoned on the streets, or entrusted to House Tokita by a distant relative...",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"If neither Kanami nor Hotori know anything, it'll be hard to investigate any further.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"But whosoever I might be, all I am now is the blade of my lord.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"The only thing I need concern myself with is following the path of fealty.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I can understand how terribly unnerving it must be to not know who you are.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But, um... No matter what, you will always be my beloved Onii-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“That is to say, er... Please do not let it concern you!”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Kanami is desperately trying to cheer me up.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Her dubious reasoning aside, her feelings have definitely made themselves clear.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you, Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"As I reach out to pat her on the head, she contentedly nuzzles my hand like a kitten.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Little by little, just like this, perhaps we can go back to the way we once were.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
